# Visual identity lock (Contiental Apple) — NON-NÉGOCIABLE

This lock applies to **every** future screen, module, gate, widget, and PR.  
No parallel design system.

**Supersedes** Utility Cube · Contiental Wick D094.

## Before any UI work

1. Read `apps/web/src/app/globals.css` (`--a-*` tokens only).
2. Reuse `AppShell` + `ModuleAppsGrid` + `AScreenHeader` + `A*`.
3. Match reference: `/` (Launchpad) · module pages · `/settings`.
4. If a screen diverges → **fix that screen**, never invent a second look.

