## Chrome (mandatory)

- Sidebar Finder: **icon + module name** + **small toggle on the RIGHT**
- Features **never** listed in sidebar → **Launchpad grid** on `/` (`ModuleAppsGrid`: icon + label below)
- Topbar: translucent search pill · no borders
- Pages: no `border-a-*` boxes · soft surfaces only
- Status = pastel `ABadge` only
- Gates `/dev/*` = `ADevPage` only
- Montants TND / stock = solid tabular

## Forbidden

- Framed cards / tables / panels (`border` chrome)
- Feature lists or badge tiles inside the sidebar
- Space Grotesk / Inter / emerald as product look
- Raw hex in `components/` (except icon gradient utilities already tokenized via tone helpers)
- Second design system

## New modules

Ship inside this shell. Ask before changing `--a-*` tokens.
